<Site title="Credits" active="credits">
  <article class="text-page personal-content">
    <h1>Hardware &amp; interface credits</h1>
    <p>A small personal tribute to the handhelds I grew up with. The apps contain my own pages; they do not run the original system software.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>GBA SP photograph: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Game_Boy_Advance_SP_blue.JPG">Danny Fenton, via Wikimedia Commons</a>, public domain. Restored and upscaled with ImageGen, with a blank screen and a cleaned cobalt shell; background removed and controls recalibrated.</li>
      <li>PSP-3000 product image: Sony, via <a href="https://www.gamesmen.com.au/console-psp-3000-black">The Gamesmen</a>. Background removed, cropped, resized, and converted to WebP.</li>
      <li>iPod touch artwork: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:4th_Generation_iPod_touch.png">iEatSoxLikeAnimal, via Wikimedia Commons</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>. Cropped, resized, and converted to WebP; the adapted hardware image is available under the same license.</li>
      <li>Midnight-purple 3DS product image: Nintendo, via <a href="https://www.thevideogamecompany.com/products/nintendo-3ds-launch-edition-midnight-purple-handheld-console">The Video Game Company</a>. Restored and upscaled with ImageGen, with blank screens and recalibrated screen overlays.</li>
      <li>Animal Crossing Switch product image: <a href="https://www.nintendo.com/us/store/products/nintendo-switch-animal-crossing-new-horizons-edition/">Nintendo</a>. Background removed, cropped, and converted to WebP.</li>
      <li>iOS 6 icons: Apple, archived by <a href="https://github.com/zagnut531/iOS-6-Icons">zagnut531</a>. Ripple wallpaper: Apple, archived by <a href="https://github.com/SniperGER/iOS-Wallpapers">SniperGER</a>. Icons are mapped to this site's personal pages and converted losslessly to WebP.</li>
      <li>3DS Camera, Sound, Activity Log, and Settings icons: Nintendo, extracted by NH1507 on <a href="https://www.spriters-resource.com/3ds/systembios/">The Spriters Resource</a>. Cropped from their sprite sheets.</li>
      <li>Film posters: respective studios, via <a href="https://www.impawards.com/">IMP Awards</a>. Locally resized WebP copies; <a href="/movies/sources.json">individual sources</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The GBA menu, PSP wave background, remaining interface drawings, and five mini-games were made for this website. Product and system artwork belongs to its respective creators.</p>
